+        #
+        # A native reply is also a message-bound security/correlation boundary:
+        # merging it with a following message loses the second message ID while
+        # retaining only the first reply projection.  Exact reserved ``OK`` must
+        # likewise reach pre-dispatch hooks as its own event, including malformed
+        # or standalone attempts that those hooks must reject fail closed.
+        _reference_present, _reserved_exact_ok = _discord_batch_boundary(
